{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50609","headline":"赴京旅次感怀 · 常衮","name":"赴京旅次感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里云烟绕画楼，客居无事转深愁。\n秋风翠阁看初动，玉露金茎望欲流。\n廿载承恩谁报主，一生僚属且封侯。\n明朝努力长安道，不爲晴川恋旧游。\n（以上二诗见沁泉山馆郭柏苍校刊本《唐制诏集》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50609.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50609","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}